<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:26:53Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>黃之鋒「勾結外國勢力危害國家安全」案認罪，最高可囚終身</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cly7r8yrxe5o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T14:11:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cly7r8yrxe5o/trad--7c6a9f67bcc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cly7r8yrxe5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">現年29歲的民主派活動人士黃之鋒，在法庭上承認一項中國《香港國安法》下的「串謀勾結外國勢力危害國家安全」罪，判刑押後至另日進行。至今，黃之鋒已失去自由逾2,100天。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國公司獲批委內瑞拉油田百年開採權 分析人士迷惑 國民震怒</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4rkd5zepo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T08:59:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4rkd5zepo/trad--82c13ac29fb1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4rkd5zepo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">委內瑞拉近期沒有舉行選舉，或者說，沒有任何明確的選舉計劃，這在許多反對者看來是一種背叛。</summary></entry><entry><title>尼泊爾—西藏泥石流：堰塞湖和冰湖是下一個「定時炸彈」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T00:01:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad--418da5ad44fa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">事發河谷上游已形成兩個堰塞湖。與此同時，原本散佈在喜馬拉雅山區的冰川湖，在災區內有10座被標記為高風險，專家形容它們是「定時炸彈」。</summary></entry><entry><title>日本企業大舉押注印度　中國風險加深之際尋求新成長</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czxzkex7nd1o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T00:01:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czxzkex7nd1o/trad--97325c610e69.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czxzkex7nd1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">日本企業正加碼布局印度，因國內市場萎縮及中國風險升高。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我從未去過的祖國」：600萬阿富汗人遭鄰國驅逐，在塔利班治下重新開始</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4g5djd75gpo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T09:18:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4g5djd75gpo/trad--6b6588da7a08.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4g5djd75gpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">今年從巴基斯坦和伊朗遭遣返回阿富汗的人數，已再增加100萬。</summary></entry><entry><title>泥石流摧毀西藏吉隆口岸的關鍵幾分鐘</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T12:01:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad--6512b63ed4b6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">吉隆口岸位處西藏與尼泊爾的重要貿易通路之上，中國與尼泊爾兩側各有數以百計外國旅客在泥石流衝擊後下落不明。</summary></entry><entry><title>尼泊爾—西藏泥石流：吉隆口岸為何是朝聖之路上的重要關口？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3d752l9vxxo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T05:14:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3d752l9vxxo/trad--cd6ea60e0e5a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3d752l9vxxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">目前至少有290名印度人失蹤，許多都正在參加朝聖之旅。其中一名失蹤者的丈夫向BBC表示，太太參加了一行30人、由印度出發前往西藏的朝聖團。</summary></entry><entry><title>數百名水力發電工人受困隧道：尼泊爾地下夢魘</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crer81r33pno/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T04:44:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crer81r33pno/trad--633263beece9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crer81r33pno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">數百名工人的家屬仍抱持希望，相信受困於尼泊爾特里蘇里河（Trishuli River）沿岸龐大、充滿泥漿的隧道網絡中的親人仍有機會被活著找到。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國審查西藏口岸遭洪災衝擊畫面，當地災民情況我們所知甚少</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T12:37:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad--5ba777fb8c53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些關於這場致命山洪暴發最驚人的畫面，中國官方媒體未對公眾播放。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃之鋒：從學運領袖到國安法囚犯，重獲自由未有期</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T14:11:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad--afefb304de53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">自2020年11月被關押以來，香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒被控多宗罪名，至今已身在獄中接近六年。</summary></entry><entry><title>Shein香港上市首日股價下跌　期待已久的股市首秀表現疲弱</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz7ze2lq0vjo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T05:24:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz7ze2lq0vjo/trad--7055a9ad8bac.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz7ze2lq0vjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">該公司股份正式在香港上市，這是其多年來試圖在紐約和倫敦出售股票之後的成果。</summary></entry><entry><title>星巴克咖啡就算了吧——Z世代喜歡喝冰飲</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c15897j72vno/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T01:19:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c15897j72vno/trad--ff3dacc6043a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c15897j72vno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">年輕消費者偏好冷飲和客製化飲品，到星巴克買熱咖啡不是他們的第一選擇。</summary></entry><entry><title>梅西退出阿根廷國家隊：「已沒什麼可以再付出了」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp8dkp32xndo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T05:03:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp8dkp32xndo/trad--d7536d79284b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp8dkp32xndo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">阿根廷足球名將梅西（Lionel Messi；美斯）宣布退出國際足壇，他形容這個決定讓他「感到痛苦」，但「時候到了」。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何台灣公視屢陷預算爭議？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gjd85e03xo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T00:15:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gjd85e03xo/trad--0d28ff3e55f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gjd85e03xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">作為開播28年的公共媒體，為何台灣公視反覆陷入預算爭議？預算及董事會人事為何多次成為台灣朝野政黨交鋒的焦點？</summary></entry><entry><title>塔吉克斯坦年輕人之間緣何興起「漢語熱」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T09:41:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad--2ac81966f858.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">直到幾年前，英語仍被塔吉克年輕人視為最重要的外語，但隨著中國在中亞地區的經濟影響力不斷擴大，漢語成為了對年輕一代更具吸引力的選擇。</summary></entry><entry><title>她放下演藝事業，回愛丁堡拯救家裏的中餐館</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T00:15:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad--d26df99023e1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">母親經營了30年的餐廳正在走下坡。因此，賀灕灑暫停了自己的演藝事業，回到蘇格蘭的家裏試一把。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國科技公司新嘗試：「性愛」機器人，瞄準「陪伴經濟」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T08:51:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad--7169231e3977.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近年來，中國的「陪伴經濟」異軍突起，AI和機器人技術的高速發展亦給這個市場注入諸多新的可能。</summary></entry><entry><title>重獲自由未有期 回顧黃之鋒的公共生涯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:26:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T13:55:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad--7214d6bbc403.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒被控違反《香港國安法》下的「串謀勾結外國勢力」罪，2026年9月2日在高等法院出庭並認罪，法官將案件押後判刑。</summary></entry><entry><title>「大家都是做做樣子」：香港高中公民科推行五週年</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c93vq6245q2o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T08:18:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c93vq6245q2o/trad--65341b5f1096.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c93vq6245q2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港高中以「公民與社會發展科」取代通識科至今已五年，學生前往中國大陸考察亦由過去的自願參與，逐步成為課程安排的一部分。2025/26學年，約有5萬名高中學生參與相關考察，政府資助逾8,400萬港元。BBC中文採訪老師及學生，了解他們在考察期間的所見所聞，以及對這類活動的看法。</summary></entry><entry><title>前線報導：BBC走訪中尼邊境被洪災抹去的小鎮</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgmryk7xky8o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T05:45:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgmryk7xky8o/trad--9696aad17a81.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgmryk7xky8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC記者阿扎德·莫希里來到夏布盧貝西，這裡緊鄰中國西藏吉隆，曾經生活在這裡的社區已幾乎不留任何痕跡，取而代之的是大量乾硬的泥土和瓦礫。</summary></entry><entry><title>前線報導：尼泊爾洪災逾900人罹難  民眾絕望尋找失蹤親人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgy4vd7ny4o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T10:56:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgy4vd7ny4o/trad--4aff2d5aaa54.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgy4vd7ny4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">尼泊爾上周遭遇毀滅性洪災，已有超過900人死亡，仍有4200人失蹤。有許多人在街頭一張張查看尋找到的遺體照片，絕望地尋找失聯的親人；也有數百人被困隧道，至今生死未卜。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港卡牌熱潮：一張卡如何從遊戲變資產成為「紙上黃金」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q7zj89qyo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T02:06:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q7zj89qyo/trad--cd50cdc3b685.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q7zj89qyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近年全球掀起一波集換式卡牌熱潮，除了玩樂以外，更有不少人用來投資炒賣。美國市場分析公司統計，2025年全球集換式卡牌市場規模達到約78億美元，到2031年有望升至128.6億美元。一張卡由遊戲變成資產，成為「紙上黃金」。BBC中文拆解卡牌熱潮的起因以及熱潮延續的可能性。</summary></entry><entry><title>霍爾木茲海峽動盪，如何在巴拿馬運河引發中美角力？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T13:39:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad--77ccfd7692d6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國再次就巴拿馬運河問題交鋒。這條戰略水道約佔全球海運貿易量5%，而美國近40%的集裝箱運輸都經過這裏。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國稱數十國助中國避特朗普關稅</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T05:11:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad--ca9553d15fcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國一份新報告稱，中國透過關稅較低的國家轉運貨物，以規避較高關稅。</summary></entry><entry><title>特習會後美中再現摩擦　「建設性穩定」能否撐到九月？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-04T00:01:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad--6863f100f319.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">關稅、台灣、安全議題再起摩擦，特習會後的美中「建設性穩定」還能持續多久？</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄的太空攻防戰：衛星如何成為現代戰爭的第一擊？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-01T09:56:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad--77d395c5dbdc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在現代戰爭中，環繞地球運行的人造衛星幾乎未曾受到波及；但到了21世紀，太空或許已不再是安全的避風港。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普政府禁止中國人形機械人進口 北京批「泛化國家安全」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-07-29T11:14:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad--e9e1ec045b93.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國正陷入一場爭奪全球機械人與人工智能領導地位的競賽。</summary></entry><entry><title>上合組織25週年：中國舞台、伊朗考驗，還是「清談場所」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8d39n7m2g8o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T14:11:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8d39n7m2g8o/trad--b2ba4faa3694.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8d39n7m2g8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「整套東西說穿了，就是共識旗幟下的中國工具箱。成員加入自己感興趣的部分，沒有人被要求成為盟友。北京不要求同盟式義務，它要的是背書、參與，以及不要阻擋（中國）。」</summary></entry><entry><title>Dolly Parton的父親生前不識字，於是她給數百萬孩子寄上書本</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ydw7pv2nzo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T11:03:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ydw7pv2nzo/trad--bd8f565dd259.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ydw7pv2nzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球各地的家庭分享了帕頓想像圖書館提供的免費書籍如何幫助他們的孩子。</summary></entry><entry><title>女性罵髒話很低劣嗎？莫迪言論引燃「蟑螂人民黨」後續辯論</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7w1xgp2ro/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T02:49:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7w1xgp2ro/trad--9f506de00e3c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7w1xgp2ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印度在野黨議員拉胡爾·甘地的言論再次引發有關性別差異的辯論，焦點在於人們對辱罵總理莫迪言論的反應是否因性別而有所不同。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國再次制裁伊朗能成功向德黑蘭政權施壓嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckg8v11revgo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T07:35:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckg8v11revgo/trad--7f1c5faef617.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckg8v11revgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國稱新的制裁是「經濟D日（economic D-Day）」，但德黑蘭領導人以前也曾挺過了制裁。</summary></entry><entry><title>慈善？演戲？科茨沃爾德？哈利和梅根會怎樣重建英國生活？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyr5y5exro/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T08:03:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyr5y5exro/trad--fa4299165593.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyr5y5exro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這對夫婦即將返回英國——他們在這裡將專注什麼也逐漸明朗起來。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國總理赴泥石流災場前線意味著什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T11:41:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad--92b9a4244bc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在中國，災難應對往往也帶有政治訊號。尤其是中共中央總書記作出「重要指示」，或總理、副總理親赴現場，通常意味著北京把事件視為需要高度關注和統籌應對的重大危機。</summary></entry><entry><title>「在我眼中它就是黃金」：一張卡如何從遊戲工具變資產？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T04:32:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad--34e32e54f479.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">市場分析公司統計，全球集換式卡牌（TCG）市場規模到2031年有望升至128.6億美元。原本屬於小朋友的遊戲工具，何以突然變成「紙上黃金」？</summary></entry><entry><title>「甲醛白菜」再現中國：食品安全監管的盲區在哪裡？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T11:07:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad--4f747496d312.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近日，中國河北省被揭發收購商為達到保鮮效果，將大白菜蘸取工業甲醛，再裝車運輸到外地，事件引發官方及輿論高度關注。</summary></entry><entry><title>人形機器人以外，一場中國機器革命正靜悄悄地發生</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804e143e9yo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T08:51:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804e143e9yo/trad--2e16c6d7a6b9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804e143e9yo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國工廠裡有超過兩百萬台機器人正在工作——而且它們的數量還在快速增長。</summary></entry><entry><title>普京首登擇捉島：俄羅斯與中國共同牽制日本？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7l9dng2eo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T09:28:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7l9dng2eo/trad--9945452187c8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7l9dng2eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這是普京執政逾25年來首次踏足「北方四島」（俄稱南千島群島）之一。當前正值俄羅斯遭遇來自烏克蘭一波接一波的無人機攻勢之際，普京為何要在此時親赴遠東登島？</summary></entry><entry><title>美國NASA全新超強望遠鏡將改寫我們對宇宙的理解</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T13:34:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad--d1936a91f9c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">羅曼太空望遠鏡（Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope）8月30日從佛羅里達州肯尼迪太空中心發射升空。</summary></entry><entry><title>「因古老而安全」：為何舊技術有時更能防範黑客攻擊？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd3r9rzyzo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T09:14:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd3r9rzyzo/trad--a299c0c67684.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd3r9rzyzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">對黑客攻擊的擔憂，促使一些人轉而使用那些被新一代網絡罪犯忽略的技術。</summary></entry><entry><title>這些藥物讓人更難以應對高溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T00:02:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad--0630c93feef5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些最常獲處方的藥物，包括用於治療抑鬱症、注意力不足過動症（ADHD）和高血壓的藥物，可能會增加脫水及其他與高溫相關疾病的風險。</summary></entry><entry><title>厄爾尼諾增強：全球海洋溫度創有紀錄以來新高</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn459py3371o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T00:22:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn459py3371o/trad--d8eef1a94a58.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn459py3371o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">歐洲哥白尼氣候變化服務的薩曼莎·伯吉斯博士表示，這項紀錄是「另一個表明海洋正面臨越來越大壓力的清晰訊號」。</summary></entry><entry><title>我六歲就來月經了，但醫生們也不知道為什麼</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz0z77y4dj2o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:25:53Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T00:10:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz0z77y4dj2o/trad--29655ccc1d5a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz0z77y4dj2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">性早熟會導致兒童過早出現第二性徵，而且對女孩的影響比例明顯較高。</summary></entry></feed>
